<title>HONG KONG: H.K. dlr Dec M-3 up 19 pct on year.</title>
<headline>H.K. dlr Dec M-3 up 19 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures as percentage changes:</p>
<p>					 Dec '96    Nov '96     Dec '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (year-on-year)  +19.0	  +22.8	 +14.9</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (month)	   -0.7	   +5.0	  +2.5</p>
<p>					 Dec '96    Nov '96     Dec '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (year-on-year) +15.8	  +10.1	  +2.1</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (month)	  +6.1	   -0.7	  +0.8</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (year-on-year) +19.3	  +23.2	 +15.1</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (month)	  -0.7	   +5.0	  +2.5</p>
<p>Loans to finance visible trade of Hong Kong (year-on-Year)</p>
<p>					+6.0	   +6.3	  +19.3</p>
<p>Other loans for use in Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>				     +17.0	  +18.5	 +11.1</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
